cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the released predictions, please cite the paper below."
title: "Leakage-free patch-based mammography classification: code, splits and per-sample predictions"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a leakage-free, patch-based transfer-learning study
  on CBIS-DDSM, Mini-MIAS and INbreast. Includes the full experiment suite, the
  exact split manifests (with the patient-disjoint repair of the CBIS-DDSM
  official split), per-sample predicted probabilities for every dataset, seed and
  architecture, environment records, and a validation script for the DeLong
  implementation.
